WEBVTT

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:10.809
Scheduled reports email the numbers to the people who need them, every day, week, or month. In this video, you’ll open a report, put it on a schedule, and choose who gets it.

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:21.927
Reports live in Dashboards, under Reports. They’re built from the same widgets. This one is the morning store report: sales, orders, overdue work and loyalty.

00:00:22.367 --> 00:00:30.367
Click Emailed to see its schedule. Choose every day, weekdays, a day of the week, or a day of the month, and the time, in your time zone.

00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:37.745
Add who gets it. Each person gets their own copy, worked out as them, so they only see numbers they’re allowed to see.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:46.520
Every email starts with a short AI summary of what changed, with the numbers underneath. The last send shows here, with who it went to.

00:00:46.967 --> 00:00:56.524
A report is still a dashboard, too. Explain sums it up on screen, Change with AI rearranges it, and Add widget puts more numbers in the email.

00:00:56.967 --> 00:01:05.415
Settings decides who can see and edit the report, and pins it to one store or project, so each manager can get one just for their place.

00:01:05.867 --> 00:01:10.731
Anyone who can see a report can also click Email me a copy, whenever they need it.

